{title: Four Horsemen}
{subtitle: Revelation 6:1–8}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 150}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m] | ×8
| [Bmaj7] | [C#] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | ×2
| [B] | [C#] | [D#m] | [D#m] |
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] |
